#: xml_doc.cpp:2280
msgid ""
"The DISC function returns the discount rate for a security. Basis is the "
"type of day counting you want to use: 0: US 30/360 (default), 1: real days, "
"2: real days/360, 3: real days/365 or 4: European 30/365."
