#| msgid "Floating point values or range of values"
msgid "Floating point values, that should be counted."
msgstr "उत्प्लावन बिन्दु मानहरू वा मानका दायरा"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 374
#: xml_doc.cpp:5335
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Floating point values or range of values"
msgid ""
"Floating point values, representing the upper boundaries of the intervals."
msgstr "उत्प्लावन बिन्दु मानहरू वा मानका दायरा"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 378
#: xml_doc.cpp:5338
msgid ""
"Counts the number of values for each interval given by the border values in "
"the second parameter."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 383
#: xml_doc.cpp:5341
msgid ""
"The values in the second parameter determine the upper boundaries of the "
"intervals.\n"
"                The intervals include the upper boundaries.\n"
"                The returned array is a column vector and has one more "
"element than the second parameter;\n"
"                the last element represents the number of all elements "
"greater than the last value in second parameter.\n"
"                If the second parameter is empty, all values in the first "
"parameter are counted."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 384
#: xml_doc.cpp:5348
msgid "FREQUENCY(Range data; Range bins)"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 404
#: xml_doc.cpp:5360
msgid "Cumulated flag"
msgstr "क्युमुलेटेड फ्ल्याग"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 408
#: xml_doc.cpp:5363
msgid "The GAMMADIST() function returns the gamma distribution."
msgstr "GAMMADIST() प्रकार्यले गामा वितरण फर्काउँछ ।"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 409
#: xml_doc.cpp:5366
msgid ""
"If the last parameter (cumulated) is 0, it calculates the density function; "
"if it's 1, the distribution is returned."
msgstr ""
"यदि अन्तिम परिमिति (क्युमुलेटेड) 0 भएमा, यसले घनत्व प्रकार्य गणना गर्छ; यदि यो 1 भएमा, "
"वितरण फर्किने छ ।"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 410
#: xml_doc.cpp:5369
msgid "The first three parameters must be positive."
msgstr "पहिला तिन परिमिति धनात्मक हुनुपर्छ ।"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 411
#: xml_doc.cpp:5372
msgid "GAMMADIST(number;alpha;beta;cumulated)"
msgstr "GAMMADIST(नम्बर;अल्फा;बिटा;क्युमुलेटेड)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 412
#: xml_doc.cpp:5375
msgid "GAMMADIST(0.758;0.1;0.35;1) equals 0.995450"
msgstr "GAMMADIST(0.758;0.1;0.35;1) बराबर 0.995450"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 413
#: xml_doc.cpp:5378
msgid "GAMMADIST(0.758;0.1;0.35;0) equals 0.017179"
msgstr "GAMMADIST(0.758;0.1;0.35;0) बराबर 0.017179"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 421
#: xml_doc.cpp:5381
msgid ""
"The number for which the integral value of standard normal distribution is "
"to be calculated"
msgstr "स्टान्डर्ड सामान्य वितरणका लागि पूर्ण मान गणना गर्नु पर्ने नम्बर"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 425
#: xml_doc.cpp:5384
msgid ""
"The GAUSS() function returns the integral values for the standard normal "
"cumulative distribution."
msgstr "GAUSS() प्रकार्यले स्ट्यान्डर्ड सामान्य सञ्चित वितरणका लागि पूरै मान फर्काउँछ ।"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 426
#: xml_doc.cpp:5387
msgid "GAUSS(value)"
msgstr "GAUSS(मान)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 427
#: xml_doc.cpp:5390
msgid "GAUSS(0.25) equals 0.098706"
msgstr "GAUSS(0.25) बराबर 0.098706"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 455
#: xml_doc.cpp:5408
msgid ""
"The GEOMEAN() function returns the geometric mean of the given arguments. "
"This is equal to the Nth root of the product of the terms."
msgstr ""
"GEOMEAN() प्रकार्यले दिएको तर्कको ज्यामितिय मध्यक फर्काउँछ । यो टर्मको गुणनफलको Nth "
"मूलसँग बराबर हुन्छ ।"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 456
#: xml_doc.cpp:5411
msgid "GEOMEAN(value; value;...)"
msgstr "GEOMEAN(मान;मान;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 457
#: xml_doc.cpp:5414
msgid "GEOMEAN(A1:A5)"
msgstr "GEOMEAN(A1:A5)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 458
#: xml_doc.cpp:5417
msgid "GEOMEAN(21; 33; 54; 23) returns 30.45886"
msgstr "GEOMEAN(21; 33; 54; 23) ले 30.45886 फर्काउँछ"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 487
#: xml_doc.cpp:5435
msgid ""
"The HARMEAN() function returns the harmonic mean of the N data points (N "
"divided by the sum of the inverses of the data points)."
msgstr ""
"HARMEAN() प्रकार्यले N डेटा बिन्दुको हार्मोनिक मध्यक फर्काउँछ (N लाई डेटा बिन्दुको उल्टोको "
"जोडद्वारा भाग गरिएको) ।"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 488
#: xml_doc.cpp:5438
msgid "HARMEAN(value; value;...)"
msgstr "HARMEAN(मान;मान;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 489
#: xml_doc.cpp:5441
msgid "HARMEAN(A1:A5)"
msgstr "HARMEAN(A1:A5)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 490
#: xml_doc.cpp:5444
msgid "HARMEAN(21; 33; 54; 23) returns 28.588"
msgstr "HARMEAN(21; 33; 54; 23) ले 28.588 फर्काउँछ"

